  "abstract": "Adds context-adaptive dynamics r[b,k], w[b,k] to the factorized-loadings oscillatory SSM (k=320, p=32), keeping residual copy and temporal/horizon gating. Includes V-orthogonality regularization (\u03bb=1e-5) and curvature loss for long-horizon smoothness. Increment MLP widened to H=96.",
